From d64b751a1e6f5be4370ee4aac54aeb584bad19a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:01:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/18] Add ghost of your best run

Positions are sampled 10 times a second, stored in whole centimetres, and
replayed as a translucent runner. Only full runs record or show a ghost,
and a respawn makes the ghost snap rather than slide through the air.
